ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=sk-ant-ITI5zu1nUUljlGRMDIsDVWl4zLgj97fO72yjDXgKnCrAN5jx

# NOTE: the app does not actually use this value. Every AI model call goes
# through the Claude Code CLI (`claude -p`), authenticated with your own
# Claude Code subscription, and the backend deliberately strips
# ANTHROPIC_API_KEY from the environment before calling `claude`
# (backend/llm/claude_client.py). So putting a real key here changes nothing.
#
# What you do need: `claude` installed and logged in (run `claude` once in a
# terminal and follow the prompt). See README.md.
